<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Nov producer output prices fall 1.6 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Irish Nov producer output prices fall 1.6 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish November output prices for the manufacturing industries were down 1.6 percent from a year ago, Central Statistics Office data showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	   Index (base 1985)   Monthly change   Yearly change</p>
<p>Latest month	   119.6	  unch		-1.6</p>
<p>Previous month	 119.6	  -0.3		-1.2</p>
<p>Year-ago month	 121.5	  +0.4		+4.1</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom 353 1 660 3377</p>
</text>
